  "ruleText": "Fis 403.15 Round Whitefish (Prosopium cylindraceum). Round whitefish (Prosopium cylindraceum) taken by any method shall be immediately released back into the waters from which it was taken.\n\nSource. #12161, eff 4-18-17; ss by #14418, eff 10-22-25, EXPIRES: 10-22-35 (formerly Fis 403.14)",
